**Ended on: pair-packed map ladder + map-fused transpose-out exit (one vdivpd/8 complex, 12<L≤80) + new @s4 staged single-sweep in-place group CT — best node times 5173 µs/transform at B=1 (L=100 graded chain) and 1.414 µs batched (L=10 B=64), single-call rel L2 2.8–4.8e-16 (chains ≤3.9e-14, tol 1e-10).**

